        {
          "text": "细茎牵着宽叶，贴在墙面就能给攀爬留个落手处。",
          "color": "gray",
          "italic": true
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  "minecraft:warped_fungus": {
    "base": {
      "loreJson": [
        {
          "text": "青蓝菌盖边缘卷起，除了种植也能引来炽足兽。",
          "color": "gray",
          "italic": true
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  "minecraft:warped_nylium": {
    "base": {
      "loreJson": [
        {
          "text": "青色菌层在暗岩上铺开，诡异菌扎在这里才长得大。",
          "color": "gray",
          "italic": true
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  "minecraft:warped_roots": {
    "base": {
      "loreJson": [
        {
          "text": "蓝绿根须扭着向外伸，种在诡异菌旁能连成一片。",
          "color": "gray",
          "italic": true
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  "minecraft:warped_wart_block": {
    "base": {
      "loreJson": [
        {
          "text": "青绿颗粒结成硬团，搭在菌柄上就有了宽厚的顶。",
          "color": "gray",
          "italic": true
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  "minecraft:weeping_vines": {
    "base": {
      "loreJson": [
        {
          "text": "暗红藤蔓一节节垂下，挂在高处便是一条细软的梯子。",
          "color": "gray",
          "italic": true
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  "minecraft:white_tulip": {
    "base": {
      "loreJson": [
        {
          "text": "白色花杯沿茎挺立，点在深色叶丛里很清楚。",
          "color": "gray",
          "italic": true
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  "minecraft:wither_rose": {
    "base": {
      "loreJson": [
        {
          "text": "黑瓣枯而完整，碰到就会受伤，摆放时要留出距离。",
